&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being responsible for the day-to-day management of various influencer and social marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on proposals for prospective clients by identifying the correct mechanic, influencers and creative for each brand and their target audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending pitches for prospective clients and assisting the Account Manager in client phone calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking responsibility for ensuring numerous KPIs are hit and campaigns are delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing and managing large budgets on multiple influencer campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting on campaigns and liaising with account managers to ensure the client is happy with the results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 1 year of relevant experience planning and executing Influencer campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience delegating and prioritising an ever-changing workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent writing and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work effectively and calmly under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand Influencer Marketing and Social Metrics (Impressions / Reach / Engagements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
