&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3713 - Associate Director, Planning - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a brilliant Associate Director to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help drive forward ambitious, insight-led media planning across the account. You will play a key role in shaping clear, effective strategies grounded in audience understanding, cultural relevance, and performance, ensuring work is both commercially strong and creatively exciting. This is a high-profile, dynamic account with significant momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities of the role:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the day-to-day running of the account, ensuring flow and accuracy of work – ensure the campaign management process follows best practice, you are across all communications and establish yourself as the first port of call for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong relationship with your clients and become a trusted strategic partner – showing a deep understanding of your clients’ business and how communications can drive growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a confident and competent communications planner who demonstrates a thorough understanding of our Systems Planning approach, while leading our planning responses from start to finish, ensuring we have a seamless working process with the implementational and specialist teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your understanding of digital, data, and marketing technology - work closely with the Digital Implementation team to ensure growth and innovation is weaved into our planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of your clients’ business &amp;amp; KPIs and how we are remunerated across the account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the commercial targets set for your business group by proactively identifying and pursuing additional services opportunities on your clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote your team’s brilliant work, both within WPP Media and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in and contribute to agency wide initiatives (i.e., huddles, stretches, pitches, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will bring strong planning credentials, excellent client and team management skills, and a confident understanding of how to plan and optimise across multiple channels to deliver impact. You will be energised by pushing the account forward and passionate about delivering best-in-class work on one of the most exciting portfolios in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
