&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Mirakl Ads Customer Success team led by Arnaud Cappelaere, Business Consulting Manager. The team consists of 4 Customer Success professionals dedicated to helping eCommerce and Marketplace operators launch and grow their Retail Media programs. Together, you&#39;ll be enabling clients to unlock the full potential of their advertising business through expert guidance, performance analysis, and strategic support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Support the preparation and delivery of client workshops, onboarding sessions, training materials, and business reviews to drive client engagement and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Monitor key performance indicators and produce regular reports to track advertising network performance and surface actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Analyze Retail Media program data to identify performance trends and growth opportunities, translating findings into clear recommendations for client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Conduct market research on Retail Media, eCommerce, digital advertising, and competitive dynamics to inform strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Document best practices, processes, and client insights — and explore AI tools to improve reporting, insight generation, and the overall client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Currently pursuing a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business, Engineering, Marketing, Data, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Demonstrated interest in eCommerce, marketplaces, Retail Media, or digital advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Previous experience with data analysis or client-facing projects (academic or professional) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to turn data into clear conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proactive and curious mindset with a hands-on approach to learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Ability to work effectively across multiple stakeholders in a fast-paced, international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Comfort working with AI tools to enhance productivity and output quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Tools Used&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Excel, Salesforce, Looker, Tableau, AI tools&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English &amp;amp; french(written and spoken) required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
